---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import HeroFoto from '../../../components/HeroFoto.astro';
import Cta from '../../../components/Cta.astro';
import { site, hrefEn as href } from '../../../lib/site';
import diego from '../../../assets/diego.png';
import irene from '../../../assets/irene.jpg';

const historia = [
  '77 Delta grew out of the experience its founder, Diego Torres, has built over more than two decades in the business ecosystem: as an engineer, as an entrepreneur, as a mentor to more than 500 startups and as head of initiatives in Web3, Data and Digital Identity.',
  'For years, Diego supported companies through their digital transformation, and he noticed a pattern. Large corporations had powerful technical teams and strategy consultancies to guide them. SMEs, by contrast, were often left disoriented by the pace of technological change: they were constantly pitched by vendors, with opaque proposals and nobody to translate the technology into their day-to-day reality.',
  'When artificial intelligence began to transform the market, that imbalance became even more obvious. SMEs sensed the potential but had no trusted counterpart to help them make it concrete. That is how 77 Delta was born: to be that counterpart.',
];

const nombre = [
  'Delta is the letter that physics, mathematics and machine learning all use for the same thing: change. The difference between one state and the next. A neural network learns in exactly this way, by calculating the delta between what it predicted and what was true.',
  'It seemed the honest name for a consultancy. A company does not need a report on artificial intelligence: it needs something to work differently next month. That something is the delta, and it is the only thing we bill for.',
];

const carta = [
  'I have seen companies get frustrated with technology projects they did not understand and commit to investments they could not sustain. And I have seen the opposite: companies that, with the right guidance, have profoundly transformed the way they work.',
  'The difference is not the budget. It is the judgment behind the decisions. And that judgment comes from someone who knows the technology deeply but also deeply respects the client’s business.',
  'That is what we want to be for your company. Not just another vendor. An honest counterpart. Someone who, when a project ends, leaves the company stronger than they found it.',
  'If that is the conversation you are looking for, let’s talk.',
];

const pilares = [
  {
    inicial: 'M',
    titulo: 'Mission',
    texto:
      'To bring thoughtfully applied artificial intelligence to European SMEs. To be the honest counterpart that helps them transform processes, teams and results, without jargon or empty promises.',
  },
  {
    inicial: 'V',
    titulo: 'Vision',
    texto:
      'A Europe where SMEs gain capability and competitiveness thanks to AI deployed with professional judgment. Technological sovereignty, data on European soil and measurable results for everyone.',
  },
];

const valores = [
  {
    titulo: 'Honesty before sales',
    texto:
      'If a project makes no sense, we say so. If a technology is not mature, we say so. We would rather lose a sale than compromise a relationship of trust.',
  },
  {
    titulo: 'Results measured, not promised',
    texto:
      'Every project starts with a quantified estimate and is tracked with verifiable metrics. We do not sell potential. We deliver results you can count.',
  },
  {
    titulo: 'Client independence',
    texto:
      'When a project ends, your company keeps the code, the data and the documentation. Continuing with us is a choice, not an obligation.',
  },
  {
    titulo: 'Technology in the service of people',
    texto:
      'AI augments teams, it does not replace them. Human oversight by default: we free up time for higher-value work.',
  },
  {
    titulo: 'Data in Europe by default',
    texto:
      'Our own infrastructure in the EU. GDPR compliance guaranteed. No dependence on third countries. Technical sovereignty from day one.',
  },
];

const sellos = [
  { src: 'accio.png', alt: 'ACCIÓ accredited provider', enlace: 'https://www.accio.gencat.cat' },
  { src: 'gencat.svg', alt: 'Generalitat de Catalunya', enlace: 'https://www.gencat.cat' },
];

const descripcion =
  'More than 20 years applying technology to real companies. Who is behind 77 Delta, what guides us and why we are called what we are.';
---

<Base title="About us" description={descripcion}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="wrap py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>About us</p>
        <h1
          class="mt-7 max-w-[16ch] font-display text-[clamp(36px,4.6vw,60px)] font-extralight leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.035em]"
          data-reveal
        >
          A consultancy with a track record, born from inside the problem.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 max-w-[52ch] text-[clamp(17px,1.6vw,20px)] text-pizarra" data-reveal>
          More than 20 years applying technology to real companies. Accredited by the Generalitat de Catalunya. With
          clients from Barcelona to Dubai. And one conviction: artificial intelligence only adds value
          when it is applied with judgment.
        </p>
      </div>
      <HeroFoto foto="equipo" alt="Professional team in a working meeting" class="lg:col-span-5" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 01 · Our story -->
  <section class="hairline">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-10 py-24 md:grid-cols-12 md:py-32">
      <div class="md:col-span-6" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">01 · Our story</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px)] font-extralight leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em]">
          From mentoring 500 startups to building technology for real SMEs.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-pizarra md:col-span-6 md:pt-12" data-reveal>
        {historia.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 · The name -->
  <section class="hairline bg-panel">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-10 py-24 md:grid-cols-12 md:py-32">
      <div class="md:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">02 · The name</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px)] font-extralight leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em]">
          Why we are called what we are
        </h2>
        <p class="monograma mt-10 text-[clamp(72px,10vw,140px)] text-oro-oscuro" aria-hidden="true">Δ</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-7 md:pt-12" data-reveal>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-pizarra">
          {nombre.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
        </div>
        <p
          class="mt-8 border-t border-linea pt-8 font-display text-[clamp(20px,2.4vw,28px)] font-extralight leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.02em] text-tinta"
        >
          The 77 is the firm's own choice.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Nota personal del fundador -->
  <section class="hairline">
    <div class="wrap py-24 md:py-32">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>A personal note from the founder</p>
      <figure class="mt-8 max-w-[68ch]">
        <blockquote data-reveal>
          <p class="font-display text-[clamp(24px,3.2vw,38px)] font-extralight leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.03em]">
            When someone asks me what we do at {site.nombre}, my answer does not start with
            technology. It starts with people.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 border-l border-linea pl-6 text-[17px] text-pizarra md:pl-8">
            {carta.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
          </div>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-8 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-tinta/70" data-reveal>
          Diego Torres · Founder and technical director
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission · Vision · Values -->
  <section class="hairline bg-panel">
    <div class="wrap py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-[62ch]" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Mission · Vision · Values</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px)] font-extralight leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em]">
          What guides us
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-[17px] text-pizarra">
          Three pillars that define how we work, what we prioritize and why we choose certain projects over
          others.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-2">
        {
          pilares.map((p) => (
            <div class="border-t border-linea pt-6" data-reveal>
              <span class="monograma text-[28px] text-oro-oscuro" aria-hidden="true">
                {p.inicial}
              </span>
              <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold">{p.titulo}</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[16px] text-pizarra">{p.texto}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <div class="mt-24 max-w-[62ch]" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display text-[clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px)] font-semibold leading-[1.2]">Values</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] text-pizarra">
          These are the criteria we use to make decisions and to choose our
          clients.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ol class="mt-12 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" role="list">
        {
          valores.map((v, i) => (
            <li data-reveal>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] text-oro-oscuro">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-[18px] font-semibold">{v.titulo}</h4>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] text-pizarra">{v.texto}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Acreditación -->
  <section class="hairline">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-10 py-24 md:grid-cols-12 md:py-32">
      <div class="md:col-span-6" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Accreditation</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px)] font-extralight leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em]">
          Accredited by ACCIÓ.
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-12 gap-y-8" role="list">
          {
            sellos.map((s) => (
              <li>
                <a href={s.enlace} target="_blank" rel="noopener" title={s.alt} class="group block">
                  <img
                    src={href(`/img/logos/${s.src}`)}
                    alt={s.alt}
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                    class="h-auto max-h-10 w-auto max-w-[140px] object-contain brightness-0 opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-90"
                  />
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-pizarra md:col-span-6 md:pt-12" data-reveal>
        <p>
          We are part of the official register of technology providers accredited by ACCIÓ, the Generalitat de
          Catalunya's agency for business competitiveness.
        </p>
        <p>
          For your company this means two things: a public body has verified us, and we meet the
          requirements to carry out projects under the digitalization programs aimed at Catalan
          SMEs.
        </p>
        <a href={href('/contacto/')} class="inline-block font-mono text-[12px] text-oro-oscuro hover:text-tinta">
          Tell us about your case →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- El equipo -->
  <section class="hairline bg-panel">
    <div class="wrap py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-[62ch]" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">The team</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px)] font-extralight leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em]">
          Who is behind {site.nombre}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-[17px] text-pizarra">
          Deep technical judgment and direct contact with the decision-maker. Specialist collaborators join
          depending on the project.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article class="mt-16 grid gap-10 border-t border-linea pt-12 md:grid-cols-12" data-reveal>
        <div class="md:col-span-5">
          <Image
            src={diego}
            width={720}
            format="webp"
            alt="Diego Torres"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full max-w-[360px] rounded-[12px] border border-linea object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-7">
          <h3 class="font-display text-[24px] font-semibold">Diego Torres</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-oro-oscuro">Founder · Technical director</p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-[16px] text-pizarra">
            <p>
              Telecommunications engineer, MBA and Master's in AI Research. More than 20 years as an
              entrepreneur.
            </p>
            <p>
              He has built business initiatives in Web3, Data and Digital Identity. He has raised more than EUR 2.5
              million in funding and mentored more than 500 startups. His vision combines technical
              strength with business judgment.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href={site.linkedin}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="mt-6 inline-block font-mono text-[12px] text-oro-oscuro hover:text-tinta"
          >
            LinkedIn →
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="mt-16 grid gap-10 border-t border-linea pt-12 md:grid-cols-12" data-reveal>
        <div class="md:col-span-5">
          <Image
            src={irene}
            width={720}
            format="webp"
            alt="Irene Martínez"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full max-w-[360px] rounded-[12px] border border-linea object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-7">
          <h3 class="font-display text-[24px] font-semibold">Irene Martínez</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-oro-oscuro">
            Training and team development
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-[16px] text-pizarra">
            <p>
              Physiotherapist and associate professor at the University of Vic, where she teaches entrepreneurship,
              innovation and healthcare management in the Physiotherapy degree.
            </p>
            <p>
              She leads Corpora, our health training line for companies, and brings the team what is hardest in any
              transformation: turning technical content into something a workforce can apply
              immediately.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://corpora.cat"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="mt-6 inline-block font-mono text-[12px] text-oro-oscuro hover:text-tinta"
          >
            See Corpora →
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Cta
    titulo="Let's talk. 30 minutes. No commitment."
    texto="A structured assessment of your company with a tailored proposal. You decide the next step."
  />
</Base>
